<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92723" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοῦς</span></b> , ὁ and ἡ: un
			contr.
		 acc. sg. masc. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.31
				</span></i>
			; dat. sg. fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόῳ</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				78
			</span></i>; gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.18.5
			</span></i> (fem.), etc.; but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.181
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.108
			</span></i>; dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοΐ</span> interpol. in <i><span class="en">
				Dorio
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.309f
			</span></i>:—<i>sumach, Rhus coriaria</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i> l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>its fruit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
				41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				142.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				127.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				83.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				702.29
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; used in medicine, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ll. cc.:—the fruit of one kind (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. Συριακή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					19.741
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. ἐρυθρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.31
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.353
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				922
			</span></i>) was used as a spice:— of another, in tanning, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. βυρσοδεψική</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.78
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκυτοδεψικός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.24.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>red ray, Lolium perenne</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.43
			</span></i>.</div>
